Subject: [gatesgarth 14/14] python2-target-recipes-blacklist.inc: add and .inc file with conditional blacklist of target python2 recipes
Date: Thu,  1 Apr 2021 18:58:42 -0700
Message-Id: <9336643e0270a851b2d5653bbc6570eac13da9e7.1617328609.git.akuster808@gmail.com>
